{"seq":3,"slug":"service-design","title":"服务设计","stage":"DONE","category":"design-thinking","chapterCount":3,"docCount":10,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/service-design","rating":{"composite":3.56,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.33,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 服务设计 简介\n\n服务设计是将设计思维应用于服务体验优化的专业方法论。与传统的产品设计不同，服务设计关注的是人与服务之间在时间线上的完整互动过程，包括所有可见和不可见的环节。在体验经济时代，服务设计已成为提升客户满意度和商业竞争力的核心能力。\n\n本知识库面向希望理解和实践服务设计的学习者，无论你是产品经理、用户体验设计师、运营管理者还是希望提升服务品质的创业者，都能在这里找到系统的方法和工具。\n\n全书共分为三章，从服务的系统视角出发，经由用户旅程的时间线分析，最终落地到每个具体触点的设计优化。\n\n第一章**服务蓝图**介绍服务设计的核心工具——服务蓝图的理论基础和制作方法，讲解前台与后台的关系、关键支持流程的可视化以及蓝图在实际项目中的应用案例，帮助你建立对服务系统的整体视角。\n\n第二章**旅程地图**聚焦用户视角的体验分析，涵盖旅程地图的构建方法、触点分析技术和情感地图的绘制，帮助你系统地识别用户在服务过程中的痛点、期望和情感变化。\n\n第三章**触点设计**将视角聚焦到用户与服务的每个具体接触点，探讨物理触点、数字触点以及全渠道一致性设计的方法，帮助你在每一个细节上提升用户的服务体验。\n\n推荐学习路径为先通过第一章建立服务系统的宏观视角，再通过第二章掌握用户旅程分析方法，最后通过第三章落地到具体触点的设计优化。建议选择一个你熟悉的服务场景作为练习案例，边学边画，在实践中内化这些工具。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"service-blueprint","title":"服务蓝图","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/service-design/service-blueprint","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"blueprint-fundamentals","title":"服务蓝图基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/service-design/service-blueprint/blueprint-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"frontstage-backstage","title":"前台与后台设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/service-design/service-blueprint/frontstage-backstage"},{"seq":3,"slug":"blueprint-tools","title":"服务蓝图工具与绘制方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/service-design/service-blueprint/blueprint-tools"},{"seq":4,"slug":"blueprint-case-studies","title":"服务蓝图案例分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/service-design/service-blueprint/blueprint-case-studies"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"journey-mapping","title":"旅程地图","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/service-design/journey-mapping","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"journey-mapping-basics","title":"用户旅程图基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/service-design/journey-mapping/journey-mapping-basics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"touchpoint-analysis","title":"触点分析方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/service-design/journey-mapping/touchpoint-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"emotional-mapping","title":"情感映射与体验曲线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/service-design/journey-mapping/emotional-mapping"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"touchpoint-design","title":"触点设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/service-design/touchpoint-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"physical-touchpoints","title":"物理触点设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/service-design/touchpoint-design/physical-touchpoints"},{"seq":2,"slug":"digital-touchpoints","title":"数字触点设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/service-design/touchpoint-design/digital-touchpoints"},{"seq":3,"slug":"omnichannel-design","title":"全渠道体验设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/service-design/touchpoint-design/omnichannel-design"}]}]}